#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_insert.rst:5
msgid "Insert text field"
msgstr "插入文本字段"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_insert.rst:9
msgid ""
"To draw more easily, the folio grid can be displayed from **Display > "
"Display the grid** or from `toolbar`_ icon |grid|."
msgstr ""
"为了更方便地绘制，folio网格可以从 **Display > 显示网格** 或 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 图标 |grid| 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_insert.rst:19
msgid "grid"
msgstr "网格"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_insert.rst:12
msgid "The text field can only be added to the `workspace`_ by `toolbar`_."
msgstr "文本字段只能由 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 添加到 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_insert.rst:14
msgid "Select the icon |textfield| from `toolbar`_."
msgstr "从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 选择图标 |textfield|。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_insert.rst:20
msgid "textfield"
msgstr "文本字段"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_insert.rst:15
msgid ""
"Click on the `workspace`_ place point where the `text field`_ should be "
"placed."
msgstr "点击 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 放置 `文本字段 <text field_>`_ 的位置。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_insert.rst:16
msgid "Write the desired text."
msgstr "写想要的文字。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_insert.rst:17
msgid ""
"Click anywhere from the `workspace`_ to top the edition process and save the"
" text content."
msgstr "点击 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 的任意位置，以在版本进程上方并保存文本内容 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_insert.rst:24
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Add**."
msgstr "如果 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 不显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > Add** 显示。"
